error[SC0404]: this frees a pointer that is not the start of an allocation
   ╭─[ a_free_of_a_pointer_past_the_start_of_an_allocation.c:5:5 ]
   │
 4 │     int *p = malloc(8);
   │              ────┬────  
   │                  ╰────── allocated here
 5 │     free(p + 1);
   │     ─────┬─────  
   │          ╰─────── not the start of the allocation
───╯
  = note: this check belongs to safety level 1
  = help: free the pointer the allocation was made with, and keep the offset in a variable of its own
